        "title": "Removing Access Points - Platform documentation",
        "content": "[Skip to content](#removing-access-points)\n\n# Removing access points\n\nIn case you've made a mistake in the MAC address of the access point or you're\nusing a new access point, you may need to remove an access point\nfrom the pane.\n\nTo remove access points:\n\n1. Go to **Location Management → Management** and then click the **List of devices** tile.\n2. Next to the MAC address of the access point you want to delete, click ![delete button](images/delete_button.png). Click **Confirm**.\n\n![delete access point](images/delete_ap.png)",
        "type": "manual"
